source: crates/cli/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: help
---
Manage project resources

Usage: rslbp project <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List project records, optionally filtered by workspace
  get     Fetch a single project record by ID
  create  Create a new project record
  delete  Delete a project record by ID
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
